# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This project needs no environment variables, in development or in production.
#
# Every tool runs in the browser, and the AI study assistant is
# bring-your-own-key: the student pastes their own free Gemini key into the
# app, it is stored in their browser, and their questions go straight from
# their device to Google. There is no server route and no key of ours, so
# there is nothing to configure and nothing to leak.
#
# Get a free key (no card needed): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
